  <p>We aim for high availability but do not owe any particular availability for the free Service. Maintenance, outages at our suppliers, or events outside our control can interrupt the Service temporarily. We announce planned maintenance in advance where possible. The apps cache useful information and can queue many changes without a connection, but offline coverage is still being improved during public beta.</p>
  <p>Should we discontinue the Service as a whole, we will notify you at least three months in advance by email or in the app and let you export your data during that period. Because the software is freely available, you can continue running mitlist on your own server afterwards.</p>

